  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1241/358/title-png.png\" alt=\"標題\"></p>\n<h2>讓甜莓與發光莓變得更加實用！</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://voxelforge-oss.github.io/voxicons/voxicons/icons-64/brands/fabric.png\" alt=\"Fabric\"> <img src=\"https://voxelforge-oss.github.io/voxicons/voxicons/icons-64/brands/neoforge.png\" alt=\"NeoForge\"> <img src=\"https://voxelforge-oss.github.io/voxicons/voxicons/icons-64/brands/forge.png\" alt=\"Forge\"></p>\n<p><strong>更多莓果用途</strong> 為您的世界新增了 14 種可製作的食物、3 項現有物品的額外配方，以及大量流浪商人的交易內容，讓甜莓與發光莓成為<strong>最佳選擇</strong>。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>新增物品</h2>\n<p>以下新物品將加入您的世界：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>黑森林蛋糕</th>\n<th>水果沙拉</th>\n<th>甜莓派</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1241/331/black_forest_cake-png.png\" alt=\"黑森林蛋糕\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1241/332/fruit_salad-png.png\" alt=\"水果沙拉\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1241/339/sweet_berry_pie-png.png\" alt=\"甜莓派\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>綜合果乾堅果</th>\n<th>果醬</th>\n<th>發光莓瑪芬</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1241/341/trail_mix-png.png\" alt=\"綜合果乾堅果\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1241/336/jam-png.png\" alt=\"果醬\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1241/333/glow_berry_muffin-png.png\" alt=\"發光莓瑪芬\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<h2>新增物品效果</h2>\n<p>兩款新增的發光莓食物附有特殊效果：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>發光莓瑪芬</strong> 會賦予短時間的<strong>夜視</strong>效果。</li>\n<li><strong>發光莓冰沙</strong> 具有：<ul>\n<li>90% 機率獲得<strong>夜視</strong>效果</li>\n<li>10% 機率獲得<strong>失明</strong>效果 —— 請謹慎選擇！</li></ul></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>舊物品的新配方</h2>\n<p>現在您可以使用莓果製作紅色染料、橘色染料與發光物品展示框：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>紅色染料</th>\n<th>橘色染料</th>\n<th>發光物品展示框</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1241/338/red_dye-png.png\" alt=\"紅色染料\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1241/337/orange_dye-png.png\" alt=\"橘色染料\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1241/335/glow_frame-png.png\" alt=\"發光物品展示框\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<h2>新增流浪商人交易</h2>\n<p>流浪商人現將買賣更多與莓果相關的物品。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1>夏季更新</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1471/311/sucover-png.png\" alt=\"封面\"></p>\n<h1>7 項全新莓果配方！</h1>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>甜莓雪酪</th>\n<th>甜莓果凍</th>\n<th>甜莓優格</th>\n<th>綜合莓果聖代</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1536/17/sweet_berry_sorbet-png.png\" alt=\"甜莓雪酪\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1536/16/jelly-png.png\" alt=\"甜莓果凍\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1536/35/sweet_berry_yogurt-png.png\" alt=\"甜莓優格\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1536/37/sundae-png.png\" alt=\"綜合莓果聖代\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>發光莓冰淇淋</th>\n<th>果醬三明治</th>\n<th>果醬餅乾</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1536/34/glow_berry_icecream-png.png\" alt=\"發光莓冰淇淋\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1536/38/jam_sandwhich-png.png\" alt=\"果醬三明治\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1536/15/jam_cookie-png.png\" alt=\"果醬餅乾\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h1>亦提供基岩版</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/addons/more-berry-uses\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://voxelforge-oss.github.io/voxicons/voxicons/badges/bedrock.png\" alt=\"徽章\"></a></p>\n<h1>探索我們的 Vanilla+ 食品系列更多作品</h1>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>更多甜蜜點心！</th>\n<th>營火創作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-sweet-treats\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1728/918/256/256/639100178371220894.png\" alt=\"更多甜蜜點心！\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/campfire-creations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1751/494/256/256/639114753367766162.png\" alt=\"營火創作\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h1>保持聯繫！</h1>\n<p>如果您有任何反饋、建議、錯誤回報，或只是想了解後續動態，歡迎加入我們的社群平台！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/kXbktKQtRD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://voxelforge-oss.github.io/voxicons/voxicons/badges/discord.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252fvoxelforgestudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://voxelforge-oss.github.io/voxicons/voxicons/badges/instagram.png\" alt=\"Instagram\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252f_voxelforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://voxelforge-oss.github.io/voxicons/voxicons/badges/x.png\" alt=\"X\"></a></p>",
